  "notes": [
    "zh-cn translations are enabled with CONFIG_LUCI_LANG_zh_Hans=y. Do not list luci-i18n-*-zh-cn in the image seed; LuCI emits those packages only when a po/zh_Hans or po/zh-cn file exists.",
    "luci-app-ssr-plus is not in the pinned feeds. It is imported from fw876/helloworld at a fixed commit, with only luci-app-ssr-plus, shadowsocksr-libev and trojan. Same-named xray/v2ray/shadowsocks packages stay on the pinned feeds.",
    "luci-app-mosdns and geo2txt come from sbwml/luci-app-mosdns. The mosdns engine stays on immortalwrt/packages 5.3.3 to avoid a second mosdns provider.",
    "airconnect and luci-app-airconnect come from sbwml/luci-app-airconnect.",
    "uugamebooster is the pinned coolsnowwolf aarch64 package. Its download URL is a public vendor binary, not an internal address.",
    "OpenClash core is a symlink package to mihomo-meta. luci-app-openclash 0.48.002 owns GeoSite.dat; the bridge must not ship that file.",
    "kmod-nft-offload is intentionally absent: upstream 89a102fd excludes it for MediaTek and keeps kmod-mtk-hnat.",
    "Enable CONFIG_LUCI_LANG_zh_Hans=y. luci-i18n-*-zh-cn is generated only for apps that ship po/zh_Hans or po/zh-cn; do not force missing translation packages."
  ]
